  "retained_failures": [
    "The preceding adapter fails seven of eight complete desktop control rectangles; native hook logs and browser content screenshot parity had not proved the displayed result.",
    "A first qualification output path nested runtime sockets too deeply and timed out before compositor startup. The new desktop runner uses a separate short private temporary runtime.",
    "The old isolated checkbox/radio fixture fixed auto-size reference dimensions to an earlier UI configuration. Its new preferred_size setting asks the existing native reference generator for actual control metrics. Both preceding and final adapters pass forty control assertions. A second long-path startup failure in the old runner was resolved by shortening its owned artifact path."
  ],
